<title>JAPAN: Home Wide - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Home Wide - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 13.86		vs	   12.48</p>
<p> Operating	  626    million	  vs	  607    million</p>
<p> Current	    810    million	  vs	  756    million</p>
